  {
    "id": "sps-socket-depth-others",
    "name": "VRCFury SPS · Socket 新深度 · 仅他人",
    "description": "NewRoot/NewTip 成对估算径向深度，按同一来源、同一孔位配对。NewTip 是根部同心长度球，不是真实尖端；不能校正横移/倾斜。先从外部靠近一次估算长度；未校准保持零。需 VRCFury Haptics/OGB。",
    "mappings": [
      {
        "oscPath": "OGB/Orf/**/PenOthersNewRoot;OGB/Orf/**/PenOthersNewTip",
        "sourceMode": "SpsSocketDepth",
        "role": "Depth",
        "isOgbSocket": true
